{"id":108,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際教育と部活を示す名古屋国際","feature_description":"名古屋国際中学校・高等学校は、教育活動で国際教育や中高一貫教育、研究開発事業を示し、学校生活の部活動ページへも自然につながる構成です。部活動（2026年度）では、運動部と文化部の活動計画を確認でき、学びと放課後活動の関係を追いやすくなっています。 2026年度の部活動一覧も公開され、活動計画と学校の方針を合わせて見やすいです。","clubs":[{"id":2409,"name":"陸上ホッケー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2410,"name":"バトントワーリング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2411,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2412,"name":"バスケットボール部（高校男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2413,"name":"バスケットボール部（中学男子・中学女子・高校女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2414,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2415,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2416,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2417,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nihs.ed.jp/program/afterschool/entry-1189.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":516,"attribute_key":"religious_background","source_url":"https://www.nichinoken.co.jp/np5/schoolinfo/sw/index.php?shl_code=587","source_kind":"nichinoken","external_school_code":"587","verified_at":"2026-08-05","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":517,"attribute